      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "e3e5d2d6-04db-445b-8d44-f1488b63c697",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Script Generation\nUses GPT-4.1-mini with \"The Shepherd\" persona. Target: 75-90 words (~30 seconds spoken). Must end with \"Visit the link in bio to learn more.\" Output is strict JSON { \"script\": \"...\" } — the parse node handles markdown-wrapped or malformed responses.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 1184,
        "color": 2
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [-864, -336],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "4220b5f6-01e7-4370-b5f9-a5f52d35b175",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. HeyGen Polling Loop\nHeyGen video generation is async. This loop polls every 50 seconds, up to 20 times (~16 min max). Switch routes to: retry (still processing), completed (extract URL), or failed (log error). If it times out, it also routes to failed.",
        "height": 384,
        "width": 2464,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [-864, 16],
      "typeVersion": 1,
